==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Bassie is a light brown wicker basket with two darker brown handles on each side, along with two eyelashes underneath her eyes as her mouth is formed into a small, cat-like smile. The inside of her head is decorated to the brim with pressed flowers that appear to be purple and pink with yellow pistils, donning green and lighter green leaves sprouting outside. She wears a purple tank-top with a bell-shaped skirt that appears to be made out of four pink flower petals. Finally, she wears green and light green striped stirrup socks.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Bassie is gray colored with darker gray handles and she has eyes pie-cut on the left. Her tank top, pistils, and purple flowers are light gray, while her pink flowers and skirt are black. Her green parts are a light gray similar to her formerly purple parts but slightly darker. Her light green parts are dark gray similarly to her handles but slightly lighter.
|-|Belle Basket=
Belle Basket Bassie is a more beige color with three white freckles on her cheeks. The purple flowers are recolored light blue and the pink ones white, while their pistils are a slightly darker blue. Her skirt, with an additional, shorter blue petal layer over it, now appears as a dress, being white like the upper half with long, saggy bell sleeves that poke through a light blue vest.
|-|Egg Hunting=
Egg Hunting Bassie is lighter brown with reddish-brown handles and round cheeks. She has more leaves in her head and which now colored pastel green, along with six pastel eggs painted in three different patterns, two of which are pink with a yellow zig-zag stripe, another yellow with a pink zig-zag stripe, and the other two pink with two yellow horizontal lines. She wears a sleeveless cloth striped with pastel yellow, pastel pink, and pastel green and has white scallops around the armholes. She wears a bluish-purple dress with white, rounded flaps on the hemline, along with darker stitches slightly above the hemline and a darker pocket with lighter stitches on its uppermost side. She wears a bluish-purple backpack with darker stitching around it, a reddish-brown bottom part without stitching, and a bluish-purple pocket with a lighter-stitched dark flap that has a light yellow button in the center with dark stitches forming an "X” shape. The backpack also has a light pink "B" on the upper half, has darker straps with buttons like the flaps, and is dark around the sides. Her stirrup socks are now colored with a pattern like her cloths. She produces leaf particles similar to the ones in her head that appear to jump out from it, and she also produces small, white, star-like particles from her head and torso.
|-|Golden Basket=
Golden Basket Bassie is a more orangish shade along with her darker handles and has three white freckles on her cheeks. She has red eyelids with red eyeshadow being shiny with lighter lines, and they form a sleepy expression. All her flowers are yellow with red pistils and her leaves are a darker golden shade, like the crown, which is placed on the right of her head, and has six points, a red oval ornamenting each. She wears three golden leaves made on her back appearing cape-like and is held together by a yellow flower on the front. She wears a dress composed of a red bodice and a white skirt with a lighter red layer on the upper half as part of the pattern. She also has a golden waistband with lighter lines that make it appear shiny like her eyeshadow, and she also wears two shiny, golden bracelets similar in appearance. The light yellow replaces the darker green on the stirrup socks and the golden yellow replaces the lighter green on them.
|-|Spring-Time=
[[Spring-Time Cosmetic Pack|Spring-Time]] Bassie is a tanner brown shade with burnt orange handles, lighter cheeks that have three white freckles, and reddish lipstick beneath her mouth. She wears a curved, Victorian-esque bonnet with white petal-like ends and a pink gingham pattern, bound to her head by a pink band with two similarly patterned leaf-shaped tails. The inside of her head is filled with sage green, four-leaved clovers with a lighter cross on the centers and two curled vines on the sides of her head. She wears white, scalloped gloves with two light pink stitches and also has short, white puffy sleeves attached to a sage green shirt with lighter vertical stripes. There are four white straps attached to a white waistline which holds a pink gingham skirt. The skirt has white, rounded flaps on the hemline and a scalloped apron, decorated with a light pink heart with a darker outline in the center. Her pants are sage green and striped like her shirt and she wears white shoes with pink collars and crescentic gaps on the vamps. She produces semi-visible pink and purple flowers with yellow pistils and green stems that sprout around her and disappear quickly as well as tiny, greenish, pollen-like specks from her torso. When moving, a transparent trail of flowers and leaves colored with a green to pink gradient expands and then fades away.
|-|Sunflower Patch=
Sunflower Patch Bassie is a yellowish-orange shade of brown with darker handles and round cheeks that are a similar, albeit slightly lighter color. Her head has more leaves which are now colored like green, and the pressed flowers are replaced with four amber-colored, eight-petalled sunflowers, each with a lighter shade on the tips and a brown center with three lighter dots. Her dress is made up of long, yellow sleeves that fade into amber at the jagged cuffs, a notched, amber bodice exposing a lime green cloth underneath, a green waistband, and eight yellow petals with amber tips for the skirt. Her stirrup socks are brown with three lighter dots above the left knee and on the right foot. She also wears two green bracelets on both of her legs.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Bassie is a shy and timid [[Toon]], being apparent at first glance due to the fact she fidgets during her idle animation. She also feels envy towards {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}, who is the fan favorite and who is the better picking for the Easter {{Type|Main}} class, as said by {{CI|Delilah Keen|name=true}} in a note to {{CI|Arthur|name=true}}. However, she does not hate Cocoa, as shown in "[[Wilting]]," where she is seen hugging her and possibly creating a gift for her. In Bassie's interactions with Cocoa, as well as the [[Gossip]] about her, she instead acts anxious and envious, with no real apparent hatred. In her Gossip about {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, she expresses care and protectiveness over all of the other [[Easter Toons]], referring to them as "friends." There does come a breaking point however, when she discovers the sheer amount of Cocoa plushies that were created, which are usually reserved for Main Characters. This combines with her already negative mindset, leading to a peak of rage mixed with sadness, eventually becoming {{CI|Twisted Bassie}}[[Twisted Bassie|Twisted]].

In her dialogues, she is seen laughing uncontrollably whenever she feels like she is not keeping up with others' expectations of her, which often makes other Toons feel uncomfortable or weirded out. As also seen in her dialogues, Bassie constantly compares herself to the other "Main" friends, saying how she hopes to be kind as {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} and intelligent as {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, as she possibly has a fear of being replaced. This is because she knows that if anyone were to replace her, it'd be Cocoa, further hinted at in Bassie's interaction with {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}.

Bassie is also known to be quite animated and defensive when confronted with certain matters, such as in her dialogue with {{CI|Astro|name=true}}. She apologizes for raising her voice after doing so, showing that she doesn't mean to come off as rude or blunt; however, it's something she cannot help.

As in seen in her descending & [[Machine]] completion dialogues, as well as her Gossips about {{CI|Gigi|name=true}} and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, she tries to be as helpful as possible. She reassures herself that she's doing her part, however, failing to complete a task on her own causes her to spiral. Bassie does have the ability to stand by her own opinions however, such as refusing {{CI|Flutter|name=true}}'s request to tell {{CI|Flyte|name=true}} not to worry so much about her, believing it's a family matter.

Bassie also has a high level of social anxiety, which usually causes her to lose control or make mistakes. Her social anxiety makes her come off as cold and she sometimes laughs uncontrollably. This anxiety also causes her to worry a lot, and she tries to keep herself controlled, though underneath there is too much pressure.

