==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first and second requirements, focus on picking up [[Research Capsule]]/[[Basket]] and extracting [[Machine]]. The Machine, Capsule and Basket count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more [[Ichor]] and Baskets.
*For the third requirement, ask a Distractor [[Toon]] to bring {{CI|Twisted Bassie|name=true}} to you, so you can get her to aggro on you. Playing as {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} also helps getting Research faster because of his Passive [[Ability]]. This will be easier if Twisted Bassie is on the [[Daily Twisted Board]].

